157
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:21,680
exactly one percent of its annual military budget to the one percent Treaty Fund for allocation to pragmatic clinical trials.

158
00:17:22,780 --> 00:17:27,839
Article Two. Transfers shall be automatic, immediate, and irrevocable.

159
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:33,920
No "we'll get to it later." Article Three. Percentages may increase but never decrease.

160
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:41,400
This is a ratchet, not a yo-yo. Article Four. Compliance shall be verified by blockchain and A.I.

161
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:51,600
