167
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:25,780
Good luck with that. Article Nine. This treaty supersedes all conflicting domestic law.

168
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:32,680
Yes, even that law. Article Ten. Entry into force upon signature by two states.

169
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:41,640
You only need two countries brave enough to go first. IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the undersigned, being of sound mind and tired

170
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:46,680
